Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.47,0:00:04.94,Main,Neko's Grandfather,0,0,0,,Happy New Year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.43,0:00:07.74,Main,Neko's Uncle,0,0,0,,Happy New Year, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.31,0:00:11.65,Main,Neko's Aunt,0,0,0,,To another glorious year, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.21,0:00:14.52,Main,Relative,0,0,0,,You look quite radiant today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.52,0:00:17.12,Main,Relative,0,0,0,,To another glorious year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.37,0:00:21.50,Main,Neko's Grandfather,0,0,0,,Indeed. I am glad to see that\Nyou're all doing well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.41,0:00:25.18,Main,Relative,0,0,0,,Oh, there's not enough sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.18,0:00:26.48,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Allow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.48,0:00:29.74,Main,Relative,0,0,0,,Oh, no, Neko-san.\NYou're just getting over an illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.74,0:00:32.92,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,No, I'm quite all right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.69,0:00:47.86,Main,Shouta,0,0,0,,Whee! Vroom!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.37,0:00:52.66,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Oh, my. Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.66,0:00:55.03,Main,Yuriko,0,0,0,,Hey! What do you think you're doing, Shouta?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.03,0:00:57.53,Main,Yuriko,0,0,0,,You need to behave today!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.53,0:00:59.03,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Yuriko-neesan?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.12,0:01:02.79,Main,Yuriko,0,0,0,,Oh! Is that you, Neko-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.73,0:01:06.65,Main,Yuriko,0,0,0,,What a surprise that was! \NYou've gotten so pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.65,0:01:09.40,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,I guess we haven't seen\Neach other since your wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.82,0:01:14.26,Main,Yuriko,0,0,0,,Yes. I think you were about \NShouta's age back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.64,0:01:17.44,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Yes, I was quite small and round.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.44,0:01:20.82,Main,Yuriko,0,0,0,,Yes, exactly! It's so hard to picture that now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.20,0:01:23.22,Italics,Neko,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.03,0:03:06.04,Episode Title,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1475,925)}#7 "{\c&H3889E7&}T{\c}h{\c&H3889E7&}e{\c}r{\c&H3889E7&}e{\c}'{\c&H3889E7&}s {\c}N{\c&H3889E7&}o {\c}P{\c&H3889E7&}o{\c}i{\c&H3889E7&}n{\c}t {\c&H3889E7&}i{\c}n {\c&H3889E7&}T{\c}h{\c&H3889E7&}i{\c}s {\c&H3889E7&}C{\c}o{\c&H3889E7&}n{\c}f{\c&H3889E7&}e{\c}s{\c&H3889E7&}s{\c}i{\c&H3889E7&}o{\c}n{\c}"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.57,0:03:03.49,Main Top,Masamune,0,0,0,,You don't know what's causing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.49,0:03:06.54,Main Top,Doctor,0,0,0,,Yes. It's not unreasonable to think that
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.54,0:03:10.36,Main,Doctor,0,0,0,,you've suddenly developed \Nsome sort of food allergy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.36,0:03:16.25,Main,Doctor,0,0,0,,But considering where your hives\Nappeared, that likelihood is low.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.64,0:03:17.75,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.22,0:03:22.20,Main,Doctor,0,0,0,,At your age, your hormones\Ncan become a wreck at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.20,0:03:26.52,Main,Doctor,0,0,0,,It's not uncommon for even a \Nlittle bit of stress to cause hives.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.25,0:03:29.32,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,A little bit of stress?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.77,0:03:33.29,Main,Doctor,0,0,0,,Anyway, take it easy for a while,\Nand we'll keep an eye on this
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.29,0:03:35.64,Main,Doctor,0,0,0,,as we wait for your blood tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.64,0:03:36.97,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Uh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.55,0:03:40.38,Main,Doctor,0,0,0,,Please come see me again in a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.38,0:03:44.32,Main,Doctor,0,0,0,,If anything else happens in that time,\Nwe'll do a more thorough checkup.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.32,0:03:46.66,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Okay. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.88,0:03:52.92,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Stress, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.22,0:04:07.93,Main,Girl,0,0,0,,Aw, I should've gotten anmitsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.93,0:04:10.39,Main,Girl 2,0,0,0,,The ozouni looked good, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.39,0:04:11.04,Main,Girl,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.04,0:04:12.73,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,The first shrine visit of the year...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.02,0:04:18.36,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,The first shrine visit of the year...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.36,0:04:20.01,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,Did you go already, President?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.01,0:04:21.03,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.48,0:04:23.18,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,For the first three days of the year,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.18,0:04:26.49,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,we go to see relatives on \Nboth sides of my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.49,0:04:29.39,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,That's where I get to experience\Nthe grueling activity of
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.39,0:04:34.46,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,babysitting all the little brats under\Nthe guise of "New Year's greetings."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.80,0:04:37.93,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,I've heard of people gaining\Na little weight over New Year's,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.93,0:04:41.02,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,but I guess you get a diet\Nand a workout for yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.56,0:04:42.92,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,What about you, Kojuurou-kyun?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.92,0:04:45.80,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,I basically spent all my \Ntime in front of the TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.80,0:04:48.39,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,I binge-watched {\i1}The Solitary Gourmand{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.39,0:04:52.35,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Aw... We just rang in the new year,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.35,0:04:55.18,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,so I want to have some fun and \Ncelebrate with all of you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.18,0:04:57.02,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,Like when we all went to the ocean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.32,0:05:00.32,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Hey, why don't we all do our \Nfirst shrine visit together?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.32,0:05:01.00,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.00,0:05:02.40,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.30,0:05:09.58,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Hey, isn't that...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.16,0:05:16.37,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs12\bord0\shad0\pos(233.333,85.334)\frz353}Messages
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.16,0:05:16.37,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs14\bord0\shad0\pos(356.667,99.333)\frz351.2}Tae
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.16,0:05:16.37,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs12\bord0\shad0\pos(507.334,120.667)\frz351.3}Edit
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.16,0:05:16.37,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs14\an4\c&HB1B4B1&\bord2\shad0\3c&HFDFFFD&\pos(259.334,191.334)\frz352.4}Hey, look behind you!\NAt the café!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.16,0:05:16.37,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs13\an4\c&HB1B4B1&\bord2\shad0\3c&HF8EEAE&\frz352.4\pos(202,130)}Tae
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.20,0:05:16.37,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Behind me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.80,0:05:31.92,Italics Top,TV,0,0,0,,I thought it was up... but it was down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.75,0:05:35.02,Italics Top,TV,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.02,0:05:38.52,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1025,1)\fs12\an4\c&HA0A5A4&\bord2\shad0\3c&HF8FCF8&\frz337.6\pos(280,154)}My stomach hurts so much,\NI can't move
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.02,0:05:38.52,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1025,1)\fs12\an4\c&HA0A5A4&\bord2\shad0\3c&HF8FCF8&\frz337.6\pos(244,225.334)}There's a present for you downstairs\Nin my coat pocket
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.02,0:05:41.02,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs10\bord0\shad0\pos(298,57.333)\frz339.7}Messages
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.02,0:05:41.02,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs11\bord0\shad0\pos(376.667,83.333)\frz338.8}Makabe Masamune
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.02,0:05:41.02,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs10\bord0\shad0\frz339.7\pos(462.667,124)}Edit
