Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.65,0:05:41.02,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs12\an4\c&HA0A5A4&\bord2\shad0\3c&HF8FCF8&\frz337.6\pos(245.333,221.334)}Please just take that and\Nleave for today
