Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.57,0:05:45.24,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an4\frx0\fry358\c&H767B7A&\bord0\shad0\b1\pos(151.334,158)\frz337.5}Also, Happy Birthday
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.05,0:05:49.58,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,A present?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.52,0:05:52.89,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,Is this it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.08,0:05:58.25,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,2103)\c&H707677&\shad0\3c&HEAF1F0&\fs14\frz54.13\frx12\fry2\pos(160,214)}I'm going to get revenge\Non that woman!!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.91,0:05:59.21,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Aki-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.58,0:06:01.90,Main Top,TV,0,0,0,,See you again next week!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.88,0:06:01.24,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Aki-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.24,0:06:02.80,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.40,0:06:06.63,Italics Top,TV,0,0,0,,This program was brought to you\Nby the following sponsors.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.80,0:06:05.34,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,The TV show is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.34,0:06:07.51,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.05,0:06:11.80,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,I guess there aren't many\Ninteresting shows during New Year's.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.80,0:06:14.31,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,It's nothing but comedy shows and sports.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.64,0:06:17.12,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Are you not going to go out anywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.12,0:06:20.62,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Where in the world am I going \Nto go in this cold weather?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.62,0:06:22.06,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You don't have any plans?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.45,0:06:27.14,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.28,0:06:33.74,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an5\fs16\bord0\shad0\b1\fay-.11\fax.2\frx0\fry358\pos(337.334,252)}January 4
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.19,0:06:33.21,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,It's not like I have any plans...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.01,0:06:36.27,Main,Tae and Kojuurou,0,0,0,,Happy New Year!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.27,0:06:38.52,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,H-Happy New Year...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.52,0:06:41.58,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Er, you guys sure have a lot \Nof energy so early in the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.98,0:06:44.88,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,Well, the president and I were just talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.18,0:06:47.51,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Talking? About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.79,0:06:50.19,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,We wanted to do our first \Nshrine visit with everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.19,0:06:52.59,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,Masamune-kun, did you already\Ndo your first shrine visit?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.59,0:06:56.36,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,No, I just stayed at home for \Nthe first three days of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.36,0:06:58.38,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Then why don't we all go together?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.38,0:07:00.19,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Huh? Right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.57,0:07:03.26,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Okay, let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.26,0:07:04.77,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.77,0:07:07.95,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Then let's go ahead and invite\NAdagaki-san and the others, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.95,0:07:09.45,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Just like when we went to the ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.45,0:07:10.14,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.51,0:07:16.38,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.38,0:07:19.66,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,E-Er, I mean, Adagaki-san seems busy,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.66,0:07:24.01,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,so I'm sure Master... Koiwai-san is, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.01,0:07:25.84,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.84,0:07:29.72,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Then let's at least see if\NFujinomiya-san is available.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.99,0:07:45.73,Flashback,Neko's Mother,0,0,0,,Come now, Neko-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.73,0:07:49.61,Flashback,Neko's Mother,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to move if \Nyou're holding onto me so tightly?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.61,0:07:51.70,Flashback,Neko's Mother,0,0,0,,You're so spooked by everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.66,0:07:56.40,Flashback,Kinue,0,0,0,,Aw, how cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.40,0:07:59.31,Flashback,Kinue,0,0,0,,She's probably around the \Nsame age as my Maa-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.31,0:08:02.25,Flashback,Kinue,0,0,0,,Oh, Maa-kun! Come here a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.71,0:08:06.17,Flashback,Young Masamune,0,0,0,,Did you find the roast beef?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.52,0:08:11.85,Flashback,Kinue,0,0,0,,Maa-kun, say hi. This is \NFujinomiya-san's daughter, Neko-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.85,0:08:13.90,Flashback,Young Masamune,0,0,0,,Aw, but where's the beef?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.90,0:08:15.39,Flashback,Kinue,0,0,0,,Go on, Neko-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.61,0:08:34.84,Flashback,Young Masamune,0,0,0,,Want some?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.90,0:08:40.35,Flashback,Masamune's Father,0,0,0,,Come now, Masamune! You can't\Njust go putting food in your pockets!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.35,0:08:42.29,Flashback,Young Masamune,0,0,0,,What? Did you want some, too, Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.29,0:08:46.92,Flashback,Kinue,0,0,0,,Oh, my. Maa-kun's pockets\Nare like a squirrel's cheeks!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.68,0:09:01.18,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs12\an7\c&H9A9D9C&\bord2\shad0\3c&HFDFFFD&\fay.14\fax-.2\pos(256,159.334)}HNY! Masamune-kun, Kojuurou-kyun, \Nand I are about to do our first shrine visit.\NDid you want to come with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.68,0:09:01.18,Main,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs12\an7\c&H9A9D9C&\bord2\shad0\3c&HF8ECA7&\fay.14\fax-.2\pos(201.333,102.666)}Tae
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.64,0:09:03.54,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,With Masamune-sama?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.61,0:09:16.78,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.02,0:09:24.65,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Happy New Year.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.65,0:09:26.65,Main,Masamune; Tae; Kojuurou,0,0,0,,Happy New Year!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.30,0:09:30.41,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,I-I look forward to spending another \Nyear with you, Fujinomiya-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.41,0:09:33.09,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Yes, likewise. To another year.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.26,0:09:39.16,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,I look forward to spending another year\Nwith you, as well, Masamune-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.16,0:09:40.44,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Likewise.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.05,0:09:46.11,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Um... Are Adagaki-san and \NKoiwai-san not joining us?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.11,0:09:48.15,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, something came up...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.61,0:09:55.04,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Okay! Onward to our first shrine visit!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.04,0:09:57.47,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,I'm gonna draw a great blessing in my fortune!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.47,0:09:58.82,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.30,0:10:02.78,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Now it just sounds like our motive\Nis to draw a great blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.63,0:10:19.13,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\c&H6568AA&\bord0\fs30\shad0\frz10.8\pos(318.667,59.333)\frx12\fry0}Fortunes
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.22,0:10:21.09,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(675,0)\an5\fnArial\b1\c&H2B2F2C&\3c&HF5FAF9&\shad0\frz300.9\frx2\fry356\pos(486,128)}Luck
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.22,0:10:21.09,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(675,0)\an5\fnArial\b1\c&H2B2F2C&\3c&HF5FAF9&\shad0\frx2\fry356\pos(340,212.667)\frz302}Great Blessing
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.22,0:10:25.02,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,0)\an5\fnArial\b1\c&H2B2F2C&\3c&HF5FAF9&\shad0\frx2\fry356\frz27.22\pos(294,72)}Luck
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.22,0:10:25.02,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,0)\an5\fnArial\b1\c&H2B2F2C&\3c&HF5FAF9&\shad0\frx2\fry356\pos(371.334,207.334)\frz28.59}Mid Blessing
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.14,0:10:28.98,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,0)\an5\fnArial\b1\c&H2B2F2C&\3c&HF5FAF9&\shad0\frx2\fry356\pos(218.667,114)\frz54.67}Luck
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.14,0:10:28.98,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,0)\an5\fnArial\b1\c&H2B2F2C&\3c&HF5FAF9&\shad0\frx2\fry356\frz61.22\pos(337.333,182.666)}Future Blessing
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.65,0:10:37.61,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(60,148.667)\an7\fnArial\b1\c&H8167C1&\3c&HF8FFF5&\shad0\bord3\fay-.42}Chocolate Bananas
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.61,0:10:39.57,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b1\c&H282836&\3c&HBDBDCB&\shad0\fay.45\pos(181.334,84)\frx350\fry20}Specialty Yakisoba
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.28,0:10:39.57,Main,Stall Owner,0,0,0,,Step right up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.57,0:10:41.93,Main Top,Stall Owner,0,0,0,,How many you want? One? Two?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.37,0:10:43.03,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,What did you wish for, Masamune-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.93,0:10:43.03,Main Top,Stall Owner,0,0,0,,All right, one it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.03,0:10:44.97,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.39,0:10:44.97,Main Top,Stall Owner,0,0,0,,That'll be 500 yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.97,0:10:48.54,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,It must've been to be able to\Nhave fun with Adagaki-san, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.54,0:10:51.94,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, yeah, something... like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.34,0:10:57.30,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Oh! Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.50,0:11:00.36,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Hagoita! Hey! Let's play Hanetsuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.36,0:11:02.05,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,Sure, sounds fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.05,0:11:05.66,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Oh, but Fujinomiya-san, do you think\Nyou'll physically be able to play?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.66,0:11:08.59,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Yes, a little exercise will be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.59,0:11:12.02,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,And this is quite nostalgic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.02,0:11:16.98,Main,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs20\bord0\shad0\c&H3F4240&\pos(60,104)}The Annual New Year\NFujinomiya Clan\NGrand Hanetsuki\NTournament
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.02,0:11:18.28,Flashback Top,Neko's Grandfather,0,0,0,,The Annual New Year Fujinomiya Clan\NGrand Hanetsuki Tournament!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.21,0:11:18.28,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Back when I was little,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.28,0:11:21.66,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,everyone in my family, as well as\Neveryone who worked at our mansion,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.66,0:11:24.80,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,would have a grand hanetsuki tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.80,0:11:27.42,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Everyone in the Fujinomiya family?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.42,0:11:29.34,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I can't even imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.64,0:11:34.44,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,I think there's actually a park nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.87,0:11:40.59,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,Well, it looks like the president\Nand I are on a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.59,0:11:42.75,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,The losing team has to buy everyone drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.75,0:11:44.55,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Bring it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.09,0:11:47.14,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Okay, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.68,0:11:48.64,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Hi-yah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.64,0:11:49.71,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.71,0:11:51.32,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,Whoa... There!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.63,0:11:53.60,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.23,0:12:00.50,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Kojuurou-kyun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.50,0:12:02.36,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,S-Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.91,0:12:11.75,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Okay, now I'm gonna get serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.17,0:12:16.72,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Kojuurou-kyun...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.05,0:12:29.63,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Man, I'm pretty exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.63,0:12:32.77,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Your face looks awful, Masamune-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.19,0:12:37.19,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Look who's talking, Fujinomiya-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.37,0:12:45.95,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Man, I haven't laughed like this in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.95,0:12:47.29,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,You haven't?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.15,0:12:50.07,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.88,0:12:54.65,Main,Tae,0,0,0,,Here. We lost, so this is on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.65,0:12:57.67,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,Were you okay with a \Nsports drink, Masamune-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.98,0:13:01.03,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,No, I'd prefer green tea,\Nsince it helps with burning fat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.88,0:13:08.76,Main,Kojuurou and Tae,0,0,0,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.53,0:13:13.45,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Well, see you when the new term starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.45,0:13:14.68,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.20,0:13:22.60,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Man, I think I had a bit too much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.68,0:13:28.74,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,The hives are... gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.59,0:13:41.10,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,I guess I ended up not seeing\NAdagaki-san since Christmas Eve.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.10,0:13:42.62,Main,Girl students,0,0,0,,Hey, I think they're over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.62,0:13:43.38,Main,Girl students,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.01,0:14:32.97,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,115)\an8\b1\c&H7B74A9&\3c&HF3F1E8&\bord4\shad0}Exam Room 1
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.58,0:14:27.95,Main,Doctor,0,0,0,,Please come see me again in two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.95,0:14:30.31,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,I will. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.46,0:14:41.02,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting, Shidou.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.50,0:14:42.80,Main,Shidou,0,0,0,,My lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.80,0:14:45.16,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,There were no issues. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.16,0:14:48.95,Main,Shidou,0,0,0,,Please go in, my lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.97,0:14:51.48,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Fujinomiya-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.06,0:14:55.48,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Masamune-sama...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.95,0:14:57.92,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,So I was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.92,0:15:02.19,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I saw someone who looked like you in \Nthe lobby and thought it might be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.19,0:15:04.06,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Are you here to visit someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.06,0:15:07.05,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,No, I'm here to get some test results.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.52,0:15:10.26,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Oh, my. Are you not feeling well?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.26,0:15:13.85,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Nah. There's nothing wrong at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.85,0:15:16.72,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,That's actually sorta the problem...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.02,0:15:19.40,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Can we give you a ride?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.40,0:15:20.19,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.60,0:15:23.65,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,You can tell me all about it at my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.34,0:15:27.40,Main,Shidou,0,0,0,,Here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.40,0:15:29.32,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Oh, um, th-thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.49,0:15:37.33,Italics,Shidou,0,0,0,,You'd better know what'll happen\Nif you do something to my lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.37,0:15:40.79,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.79,0:15:43.94,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting, Masamune-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.69,0:15:48.62,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,These are a gift from Kyoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.62,0:15:49.71,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.04,0:15:53.43,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,So, is something troubling you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.82,0:15:59.18,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,The fact that I'm discussing\Nhealth issues with Fujinomiya Neko
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.18,0:16:01.37,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,is a bit short-sighted, even for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.96,0:16:06.40,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Well... is there such a thing as
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.40,0:16:10.12,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,stress affecting your body when there's \Ntechnically nothing wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.89,0:16:13.39,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,That's weird, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.39,0:16:14.99,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,If we're talking about stress...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.45,0:16:20.28,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,It should've been way worse when I was\Nhiding my origins and plotting my revenge...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.62,0:16:24.25,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Is it because I still have\Nsomething I haven't said?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.48,0:16:29.62,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,But if I say that,\Nit'll affect Koiwai-san, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.65,0:16:50.84,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Or perhaps...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.84,0:16:54.70,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Maybe the cause is the fact that\Nyou don't have a lie to tell anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.67,0:16:58.62,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I don't have a lie to tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.57,0:17:06.33,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,I have the perfect phrase to describe\Nyou right now, Masamune-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.64,0:17:09.04,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,And what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.22,0:17:15.01,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Burnout syndrome.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.26,0:17:22.72,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Seeing your revenge through\Nwas your reason to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.72,0:17:24.65,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,That was your lifelong wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.05,0:17:29.52,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,But that must mean that it having \Ndisappeared suddenly is still a shock to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.52,0:17:32.69,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,despite the fact that you're\Ngoing out with Aki-sama now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.94,0:17:36.15,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Because you don't actually love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.32,0:17:39.37,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,But... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.37,0:17:42.28,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Used to love her back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.15,0:17:49.38,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Is the past that important?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.38,0:17:50.75,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.75,0:17:56.09,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,I know this may not matter now,\Nbut the truth is...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.09,0:17:58.76,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,I met you once before, a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.63,0:18:05.98,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Long before Aki-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.98,0:18:07.05,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.94,0:18:09.94,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Do you not remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.44,0:18:14.96,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,It was my relative Yuriko-neesan's wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.96,0:18:20.41,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Your family was invited due to\Nthe groom's business relations.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.41,0:18:22.18,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,H-Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.92,0:18:31.13,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.13,0:18:34.11,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Even after all that, I don't remember it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.11,0:18:36.97,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,I can't blame you for not remembering.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.23,0:18:44.52,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,I had half forgotten about it myself
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.52,0:18:47.23,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,while I was wondering if I should \Nhave my surgery or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.59,0:18:52.73,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Masamune-sama, do you remember\Nbeing here and saying,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.73,0:18:57.76,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,"You don't actually like me, either"?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.76,0:19:00.04,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, of course...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.68,0:19:06.30,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I remember that much...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.31,0:19:12.54,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,It frustrated me, but I couldn't argue.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.54,0:19:19.92,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Because I was trying to start a game of love\Njust based on my meager memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.56,0:19:22.39,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Fujinomiya-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.84,0:19:25.05,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,But you see, Masamune-sama...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.05,0:19:28.00,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Even if my original intentions were dishonest,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.00,0:19:31.74,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,I'm not going to disparage\Nthe person I've been since.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.16,0:19:33.10,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.64,0:19:39.65,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,I can say this without any hesitation now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.16,0:19:42.11,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,The past doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.77,0:19:46.26,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,I've fallen in love with you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.64,0:19:50.47,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.39,0:19:56.75,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,I recommend casting aside your \Npretenses and preconceptions.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.20,0:20:00.63,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,So that you stop\Nblaming yourself, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.35,0:20:09.97,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Of course... I wouldn't mind\Nhelping you with that if I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.65,0:20:22.11,Main,Shidou,0,0,0,,Hold it right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.11,0:20:24.00,Main,Shidou,0,0,0,,Please move, my lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.00,0:20:25.78,Main,Shidou,0,0,0,,I'm going to extinguish this fool at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.24,0:20:30.30,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Wha— Shidou-san! Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.66,0:20:34.67,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,There's nothing to worry about, Shidou.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.95,0:20:44.51,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,No mistakes will be happening here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.51,0:20:46.55,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Wait, this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.97,0:20:53.62,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,I think I'm also in need of casting aside\Nmy pretenses and preconceptions.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.18,0:21:02.11,Main,Neko,0,0,0,,Masamune-sama, let me get \Nyou some more coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.71,0:21:18.67,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(226,24.667)\fs20\bord0\shad0}Messages
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.71,0:21:18.67,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs20\bord0\shad0\pos(407.333,18.667)}Cruel Princess
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.71,0:21:18.67,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs18\an4\c&H9EA3A2&\bord2\shad0\3c&HFDFFFD&\frz359.3\pos(282.666,184.667)}You went to the hospital, didn't you?\NWas everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.71,0:21:18.67,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs14\an4\c&H7B7875&\bord2\shad0\3c&HF8F0AB&\frz359.3\pos(159.333,102.001)}Cruel Princess
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.95,0:21:26.34,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Pretenses and preconceptions, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.76,0:21:31.11,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,If there's a haze over my eyes right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.78,0:21:34.47,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,If there's some other truth...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.10,0:21:39.45,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Then I sure the hell would \Nlike to know what it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.06,0:21:40.86,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.44,0:21:42.32,Main,People,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.32,0:21:43.37,Main,People,0,0,0,,Come on, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.37,0:21:44.44,Main,People,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.84,0:21:46.70,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,Crap! Was that my fault?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.16,0:21:51.74,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.63,0:21:56.02,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Master?
